<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n99896" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεκ-βάλλω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cast out along with</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ τέκνῳ τὰς μήτρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.108
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ πνεῦμα μετὰ τῶν φθόγγων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Aud.</u>
					804b9
				</span></i>
			; of the effects of sneezing, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				2.883
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				6.97
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>assist in casting out</i> or <i>expelling</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				3.2.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.5.33
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Περίανδρον τοῖς
			ἐπιθεμένοις</span> Periander <i>with the help of</i> the
			other assailants, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1304a32
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr. of a
			river, <i>discharge itself together</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				14.23
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
